<title>INDIA: India's UTI Money market fund NAV 10.2339 rupees.</title>
<headline>India's UTI Money market fund NAV 10.2339 rupees.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-run mutual fund Unit Trust of India (UTI) said on Wednesday the net asset value of its money market mutual fund was 10.2339 rupees on July 17.</p>
</text>
